      "passage_id": 6,
      "quote": "42.1    In the event this Agreement is terminated pursuant to the provisions of         paragraph 17, then the Party in default shall not enter into an         agreement with any other Party to provide services similar to those         provided herein or to provide its services similar to those provided for         herein without an agreement, for a period of six (6) months from the         effective date of termination."
    },
